{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ef2a2c59d5cea881f9e89d7707563fe5a21d2dbcd532f905bc2eb6b08c9f96c",
      "text": "巧克力点心广告的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1c4a8e5b9bfc3f26a18636de0c567f37fec85eb674b5e26c3705d20742aa3c1",
      "text": "下次广告要宣传的巧克力送到事务所了，\n冬马先生尝过了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccc713de313a275a01aa1c8fe097623d4a0072c122ccac5c25821c56e083ecfd",
      "text": "嗯，吃了！送了整整一箱过来，\n真让人开心啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85bbf98017be63dccca47c1a536d4152871e1f56463853a3ed48d752dd4ec5fb",
      "text": "大家也都超级高兴呢。\n对味道的评价也很棒哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3161da634537d22b5e6f3138a3c6c6370f59ce17e11e59242c5d42979873109",
      "text": "不止是我，必须要把事务所大家感受到的美味\n好好传达出去才行啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28e3c744b3453b5fda2080bf599feb971f0227cab874b455414228c866b3086b",
      "text": "是啊！请加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:598645f44bb34b6fe33555897832ba5262fd7bfa1d2f512a3288805832051871",
      "text": "广告里也说过，会拍几个\n吃巧克力时的表情特写对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:170733d855b45aeecf88fc1c9b16c8668e5de9ff83a7d2aae8c51139fcae2404",
      "text": "所以我想参考大家吃得津津有味时的\n表情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18db9a4975fbd633f19e5a61b9e0ea8cbd321e74ac87017a7ba271f63c5707ce",
      "text": "这样一来我想也能增加一些变化。\n主意不错吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81d9fb0ae7d7872c9db1748953acc637c4600e811b7f1e25d363bf1d2d16926a",
      "text": "确实呢。还能展现出和平时的冬马先生不太一样的\n气质，我觉得很好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_03:1_5_001_03:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:623ae03029bc54d01aae1f28daad9c8bac24e4133cb90977c098b5dbd4c0818f",
      "text": "对吧！\n那我们就去摄影棚吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
